From 7ce0cb238fd9e5d6ff6a989a052391ba89794aec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dimitri John Ledkov <dimitri.ledkov@surgut.co.uk>
Date: Sat, 9 Aug 2025 04:29:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] tls: apply TLS FIPS hardening

Disable TLS_RSA_* and *CHACHA20* ciphers by default. These are
deprecated universally, and disallowed for FIPS respectively.
---
